/E (Putting cold water on your face while holding your breath activates a reflex that slows down your heart rate and calms down your body. Here are three ways you can try this technique when you feel distressed or out of control:)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
559 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1649 0 R
